        "id": 2028259056,
        "content": "There is the [deployment script](https://github.com/ubiquity/nft-rewards/blob/f3aff74902c9c9814bdb0ffb1c213fbe7cba9360/script/Deploy001_NftReward.s.sol) responsible for creating a new [NftReward](https://github.com/ubiquity/nft-rewards/blob/f3aff74902c9c9814bdb0ffb1c213fbe7cba9360/src/NftReward.sol) contract.\r\nThe [NftReward's](https://github.com/ubiquity/nft-rewards/blob/f3aff74902c9c9814bdb0ffb1c213fbe7cba9360/src/NftReward.sol) contract address should be the same across all networks.\r\nWhat should be done:\r\n- update the [deployment script](https://github.com/ubiquity/nft-rewards/blob/f3aff74902c9c9814bdb0ffb1c213fbe7cba9360/script/Deploy001_NftReward.s.sol) to use `create2` so that we could have the same [NftReward's](https://github.com/ubiquity/nft-rewards/blob/f3aff74902c9c9814bdb0ffb1c213fbe7cba9360/src/NftReward.sol) contract address across all networks\r\nP.S. Note to self. When current issues is solved:\r\n1. Redeploy the NFT reward contract\r\n2. Update [readme](https://github.com/ubiquity/nft-rewards) with the new address\r\n3. Set minter (defined [here](https://github.com/ubiquibot/comment-incentives/blob/d68ab4b4635e19d7facbd06259d25f4f30ea0e90/src/handlers/issue/generate-erc721-permit-signature.ts#L6)) in the contract's storage via `setMinter()`\r\n4. Update NFT contract address [here](https://github.com/ubiquibot/comment-incentives/blob/d68ab4b4635e19d7facbd06259d25f4f30ea0e90/src/handlers/issue/generate-erc721-permit-signature.ts#L7)",
